{"id":"882078e652582791","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-random-ce-complete.md","title":"计算随机点的c.e.集必完全","display":"thm-random-ce-complete — 计算随机点的c.e.集必完全","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-random-ce-complete","aliases":["43-thm-random-ce-complete"],"display":"thm-random-ce-complete — 计算随机点的c.e.集必完全","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-wtt]]","[[43-df-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Theorem 11.2.1; Corollary 11.2.2","source_printed_pages":"253","source_pdf_pages":"273","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-random-ce-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-random-ce-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random-ce-complete — 计算随机点的c.e.集必完全"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.2.1; Corollary 11.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"253"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"273"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\rm wtt}\">\\(\\le_{\\rm wtt}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{\\prime}\">\\(\\varnothing^{\\prime}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。集合与其特征序列识别；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\equiv_{\\rm wtt}D\">\\(B\\equiv_{\\rm wtt}D\\)</span> 缩写为双向弱真值表归约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land X\\le_TB\\Rightarrow B\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{\\prime}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land X\\le_TB\\Rightarrow B\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{\\prime}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land X\\le_{\\rm wtt}B\\Rightarrow B\\equiv_{\\rm wtt}\\varnothing^{\\prime}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land X\\le_{\\rm wtt}B\\Rightarrow B\\equiv_{\\rm wtt}\\varnothing^{\\prime}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式不限于B本身随机：任何c.e.上界计算随机点就已经完全。书中KC请求构造迫使B在停机集入数时改变；若原归约有可计算使用界，同一构造保留这一界。已核对两个陈述，未重演递归定理及KC构造。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.2.1; Corollary 11.2.2；印刷页253，PDF页273。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","tar